 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "For questions 2–5, use the following to answer each question.\n<blockquote>\n  <p>The scatter plot shows the number of minutes people had to wait for service at a restaurant and the number of waitstaff available at the time.</p>\n <img alt=\"A scatter plot. Horizontal, 0 to 9, by point 5’s, labeled staff. Vertical, 0 to 13, by point 5’s, labeled wait time. 10 dots trend linearly down and to the right.\" src=\"exercises/media/24ad6cfc7108f2e5.svg\">   <p>A line that models the data is given by the equation <span data-math=\"y=-1.62x+18\">y=-1.62x+18</span>, where <span data-math=\"y\">y</span> represents the wait time, and <span data-math=\"x\">x</span> represents the number of waitstaff available.</p>\n</blockquote>",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 646499,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<div>\n  <ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"2\">\n    <li>The slope of the line is <span data-math=\"-1.62\">-1.62</span>. What does this mean in this situation?</li>\n  </ol>\n</div>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1272777,
     "content_html": "When there are 18 staff people, there is no wait time"
    },
    {
     "id": 1272778,
     "content_html": "When there are 0 staff people, the wait time is 18 minutes"
    },
    {
     "id": 1272779,
     "content_html": "For every wait time increase of 1 minute the staff people increase by 1.62"
    },
    {
     "id": 1272780,
     "content_html": "For every increase of 1 staff person, the wait time decreases 1.62 minutes"
    }
   ],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "multiple-choice"
   ],
   "combo_choices": []
  },
  {
   "id": 646500,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\">\n  <li>The slope of the line is <span data-math=\"-1.62\">-1.62</span>. Is it realistic to conclude, for this slope, as <span data-math=\"x\">x</span> increases, <span data-math=\"y\">y</span> will decrease?</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1272781,
     "content_html": "Yes"
    },
    {
     "id": 1272782,
     "content_html": "No"
    }
   ],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "multiple-choice"
   ],
   "combo_choices": []
  },
  {
