   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"5\">\n  <li>The <span data-math=\"y\">y</span>-intercept is <span data-math=\"(0,18)\">(0,18)</span>. Is this a realistic <span data-math=\"y\">y</span>-intercept point if <span data-math=\"y\">y</span> represents the wait time and <span data-math=\"x\">x</span> represents the number of staff available?</li>\n</ol>",
